<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: warcasket -->
  <MDWC_WarcasketTrait_Medic.degreeDatas.warcasket.label>戰棺</MDWC_WarcasketTrait_Medic.degreeDatas.warcasket.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is entombed in a warcasket. No amount of pain will have an effect on {PAWN_objective}, and {PAWN_pronoun} can never go into a pain shock or drop unconscious due to pain. Because of how bulky the armor is and how much energy it takes to use it, {PAWN_nameDef} is not capable of most work, but can still do doctor work. -->
  <MDWC_WarcasketTrait_Medic.degreeDatas.warcasket.description>{PAWN_nameDef}被封在戰棺內。再劇烈的疼痛也影響不了{PAWN_objective}，{PAWN_pronoun}永遠不會陷入劇痛休克，也不會因疼痛而失去意識。由於裝甲十分笨重，使用時又極為耗能，{PAWN_nameDef}無法從事大多數工作，但仍可從事醫護工作。</MDWC_WarcasketTrait_Medic.degreeDatas.warcasket.description>
</LanguageData>
